<view wx:if="{{visible}}" class="membership-prompt" catch:tap="close">
  <view class="membership-prompt__panel" catch:tap="">
    <view class="membership-prompt__title">开通会员，解锁完整练习</view>
    <text class="membership-prompt__body">免费用户每天仅可进行 3 次随机练习，其他练习方式需开通会员。会员期间不限练习次数。</text>
    <view class="membership-prompt__actions">
      <button class="membership-prompt__later" bind:tap="close">暂不开通</button>
      <button class="membership-prompt__confirm" bind:tap="confirm">开通会员 ¥28/半年</button>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
